    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d63">

                <pb facs="0212" n="842" sameAs="frus:frus1873p1v2/pg842"/>

                <head>No. 369.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">General <persName corresp="#p_DES1"
                            type="from">Sickles</persName> to Mr. <persName corresp="#p_HF1"
                            type="to">Fish</persName>.</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Received December 25, 10 a.m.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1872-12-24"><hi rendition="#italic">24 <hi rendition="#italic"
                                    >December</hi>, 1872</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Minister of ultramar presented to-day in the chambers of deputies the bill for
                    immediate emancipation in Porto Rico. No doubt is entertained of its speedy
                    passage.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><persName corresp="#p_DES1">SICKLES</persName>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
